{
  "id": "2CH.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Amakuru 28",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi kutwara hakaba aina emyaka 20. Akatwara emyaka 16 ayemire Yerusalemu. Tiyashemeleize Mukama nka Daudi ishenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarondora abakama ba Isiraeli, yahesha n'ebishushani bya Baali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yayotera n'obunuma omu Ruhanga rwa mutabani wa Hinomu, n'abatabani yabatamba ebitambo, yabokya; yakora amahano nk'ag'amahanga ag'Omukama yabingire omu maisho ga Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagya omu buju bw'aha mabanga yatamba ebitambo, yayotera n'obunuma aha nshozi eiguru n'aha bigabiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okufakara kwa Ahazi, Omukama Ruhangawe yamunaga omu mikono y'Omukama wa Siria. Omukama ogwo yamusinga, n'abantube batali bake yabatwara endore Damasiko. Yashuba yagwa n'omu mikono y'Omukama wa Isiraeli, yamwitira n'abantu bangi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba omu kiro kimoi Peka eya Remalia omuli Yuda akaitamu abantu 120,000, mara bona bashangwa bali baisherukale. Okufa batyo bakaba baanagire Omukama Ruhanga wa baish'enkurubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zikiri emanzi ya Efraimu, yaita Maaseya omwana w'omukama, na Azirikamu omukuru w'eihe elyalindaga ekikaare, na Elikana katikiro w'omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli bakakwata abanyaruganda babo 200,000 endore, abakazi abaana bojo n'abaana baisiki babanyaga n'ebintu bingi babitwara Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Samaria hashangwa naturwamu omurangi w'Omukama, nayetwa Odedi. Agenda atanganwa eihe nilija Samaria, abagambira ati, “Ruhanga wa bashwenkurw'inywe anigaliire Yuda, yabaanaga omu mikono yanyu, kyonkai kandi inywe mwabaisa ekiniga kingi muno mwamutamisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mbwenu nimwenda abantu ba Yuda na Yerusalemu kubahindura bairu banyu, omushaija n'omukazi. Isi inywe timukafakaliraga Mukama Ruhanga wanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumpulilize: Abanyaruganda banyu endore mubagarureyo, kuba Omukama yabanigalira muno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abatwazi abandi ba Efraimu abhalimu Azaria eya Yohanani, Berekia eya Meshilemoti, Yehizikia eya Shalumu na Amasa eya Hadilai, barwanisa abalikutabaruka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "babagambira bati, “Endore mutazileta munu. Mutatuletelera; amafu ago tufakaliire Omukama mushube mutwongereho n'obufu obundi? Tufakaire entambara mpango muno, n'Omukama anigaliire muno Isiraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo abatabaruki bataishura endore n'eminyago omu maisho g'abatwazi n'embaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija abatondwa amabara, baimuka bakora omu minyago baihamu emyendo bajweka endore ezabaire zili bushai. Babajweka, babaha ebiratwa, babalisa, babanyoisa, babasiiga n'amajuta. Ababaire bataina mani babateka aha ndogobe, babaletera abanyaruganda babo omuli Yeriko, ekigo ky'emikindo. Bonene bagaruka Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu makiro ago, Omukama Ahazi atumaho omukama wa Siria obujuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Abaedomu bakaba bashubire kutabalira Yuda, babatera, batwara n'endore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'Abafilisiti bakaba bazinzire ebigo omuli Shefela na Negebu eya Yuda, bakwata ebigo bya Betishemeshi, Aihaloni, Gederoti na Soko n'ebyaro byayo, Timuna n'ebyaro byayo na Gimzo n'ebyaro byayo, batura omwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akatera Yuda ahansi yagitura Ahazi omukama wa Isiraeli, kuba akakolera amahano omuli Yuda, yagokera Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Tigilatipileseri omukama wa Siria kumutabalira, aha mwanya gw'okumwemamu yamubonabonyia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Ahazi akahakura Rwensinga n'ekikaare n'amaju g'abatwazi, yasholera omukama wa Siria omushoro, kyonkai byabura nshai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kuyengakwe okwo, Ahazi wenene yayeyongera kuhemukira Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatambira baruhanga ba Damasiko ebitambo, mara okwo abantu ba Damasiko nibo babaire bamuteire. Wenene ati, “Baruhanga b'abakama ba Siria bakabajuna, nanye kambatambire ebitambo baije banjune.” Kyonkai baruhanga abo bakamulimira obwina na Isiraeli yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwata ebikwato bya Rwensinga abitematema, Rwensinga yonene enyigi zayo azikoma, n'omuli buli pembe ya Yerusalemu ayombekamu ealutare eza wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kigo ekya Yuda ayombekamu obuju bw'okwotezamu baruhanga abandi obunuma, yanigaza Omukama Ruhanga wa baishenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu ebindi ebyo Ahazi yakozire, kwema aha mbandizo kuhika aha nzindo, leba bihandikirwe omu Kitabo ky'Abakama ba Yuda na Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atahya, bamubyalira Yerusalemu omu kigo; omu magashani g'abakama ba Isiraeli omwo tibamubyaliiremu. Hezekia omutabani amusikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
